  %-  tlc-sum
  %+  check:check  '---------------------- MODULE HourClock ----------------------\0aEXTENDS Naturals\0aVARIABLE hr\0aHCini  ==  hr \\in (1 .. 12)\0aHCnxt  ==  hr\' = IF hr # 12 THEN hr + 1 ELSE 1\0aHC  ==  HCini /\\ [][HCnxt]_hr\0a--------------------------------------------------------------\0aTHEOREM  HC => []HCini\0a==============================================================\0a'
  '(***************************************************************************)\0a(* This is a TLC configuration file for testing that HCini is an invariant *)\0a(* of the specification HC                                                 *)\0a(***************************************************************************)\0a\0aSPECIFICATION HC\0a   \\* This statement tells TLC that HC is the specification that it\0a   \\* should check.\0a\0aINVARIANT HCini\0a   \\* This statement tells TLC to check that formula HCini is an\0a   \\* invariant of the specification--in other words, that the\0a   \\* specification implies []HCini.\0a'
